eve-celld-sandbox

The just-bash adapter, AgentFS workspace store, execution journal, portable
bundle transformation, and integration fixtures were adapted from
https://github.com/ewhauser/eve-durable-object (commit e50d130).
Copyright (c) 2026 eve-durable-object contributors. MIT License (LICENSE).

The Worker bundles include just-bash 3.4.2 with a build-time transformation
that preserves typed interpreter failures. just-bash and Eve are Apache-2.0.
AgentFS and the Cloudflare Sandbox SDK retain their upstream licenses.
Upstream legal comments are preserved in the Worker bundles. License declarations
and supplied license texts for bundled npm packages are recorded in
dist/worker/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt. Reference license texts and the Eve NOTICE
are included in licenses/.

The original example's snapshot execution design references Cloudflare Think
and Computer; their MIT license texts are included in licenses/.
